        "title": "State composition tree"
      },
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-state-composition-job-vocabulary-21": {
      "id": "b-10-state-composition-job-vocabulary-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A job is one durable request for executable work in the jobs table. Its kind selects the registered descriptor and consumer policy. A ClaimToken is the {jobId, kind, leaseId} fence minted by claim and required for durable worker writes. An executor is the WorkerExecutor port that submits, polls, collects, or cancels a task; local uses LocalProcessExecutor, while sandbox reserves the same port for a future Daytona adapter."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
